---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Panhandle Headlight Restoration"
  description="Family-run mobile headlight restoration based in Marianna, Florida. A subsidiary of Aspect Media Holdings, LLC. Serving the Florida Panhandle, South Alabama, and Southwest Georgia."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2>Local. Family-run. Built for Florida.</h2>
      <p>Panhandle Headlight Restoration is a mobile service based in Marianna, Florida. We come to your home, workplace, or lot, restore your headlights on-site, and back the work with a written guarantee.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Why we exist</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Cheap restoration jobs in this climate haze back within months because they skip the sealing step. Florida&rsquo;s year-round UV index runs 10 to 11 &mdash; roughly twice the northern US average &mdash; and standard consumer kits are not rated for that. We built the service around the seal, not the sanding, and matched three professional coatings to three real durability windows.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Who we are</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Panhandle Headlight Restoration is a subsidiary of Aspect Media Holdings, LLC, a Florida limited liability company based in Marianna, Jackson County. We stand behind our work with a written workmanship guarantee, and we back retail customers with a personal discount for military, veterans, law enforcement, first responders, and school employees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Where we work</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Marianna and Jackson County are home base. From there we serve the wider Florida Panhandle, South Alabama, and Southwest Georgia. Free service within about 30 miles; a modest travel fee farther out. Full map on the <a href="/service-area/" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">service area</a> page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">How to reach us</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Call or text <a href="tel:+18505836322" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">(850) 583-6322</a>, email <a href="mailto:info@panhandleheadlights.com" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">info@panhandleheadlights.com</a>, or start with a <a href="/quote/" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">free quote</a>. We reply by text, usually same day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
